  - Id: tool.lifeform-matrix
    Kingdom: 3
    DisplayName: Lifeform Matrix
    Tagline: The release bench. Fly through for the three kingdoms - Fauna, Flora,
      Vessels. A kingdom opens its species row; a species opens its four elements;
      a variant spawns it live. A vessel releases an AI companion in your domain.
    Description: 
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 601651507d53ea4408ef4abcaf486d2b, type: 3}
    SourcePrefab: {fileID: 0}
    SourceConfig: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6b3d92c47ae14f08b5c1e0d7f3a2958c, type: 2}
    AccentColor: {r: 0.75, g: 1, b: 0.85, a: 1}
    UnlockedByDefault: 1
    DiscoveryKey: use.tool.lifeform-matrix
    PreviewYaw: -28
    PreviewPitch: 16
    PreviewPadding: 1.05
    FlatSilhouette: 0
    Group: "3 \xB7 Creation"
    SortOrder: 0
    LockAutoHarvest: 0
    Stats:
    - Label: Kind
      Value: "Creation \u2014 it LEAVES SOMETHING BEHIND that lives on without you:
        conserved mass, or a population"
      Authored: 0
    - Label: Activation
      Value: "Fly your vessel through its ring \u2014 the ring IS the trigger volume,
        drawn at its own radius, so what you can see is what you can cross"
      Authored: 0
    - Label: Objective
      Value: "None. A tool has no score, no end condition and nothing on a clock
        \u2014 it is a thing to play with for as long as you like"
      Authored: 0
    - Label: In your toybox
      Value: "Yes \u2014 unlocked from the start"
      Authored: 0
    - Label: Found at
      Value: "Out by the cell membrane, at 180\xB0 around the cell"
      Authored: 0
    - Label: Form
      Value: One station that opens into three kingdoms; a kingdom opens its species,
        and a species opens its four elements
      Authored: 0
    - Label: Offers
      Value: 14 species and 8 hulls, across three kingdoms
      Authored: 0
    - Label: What it releases
      Value: "The real thing, live into the cell around you \u2014 not a preview"
      Authored: 0
    - Label: Afterwards
      Value: 'Everything released is an ordinary citizen: lifeforms feed, starve,
        breed and drop their crystal; a companion vessel flies and lays mass the
        food web grazes'
      Authored: 0
    - Label: Elements
      Value: "A lifeform is its species and its element and nothing else \u2014 the
        four stations wear the element's own crystal, because elements have shapes
        and domains have colours"
      Authored: 0
    Variants:
    - Label: Fauna
      Element: 0
